- source: planning-mds/features/F0021-native-react-semantic-shell-and-oidc-session/bff-api-design.yaml
  target: planning-mds/api/brain-api.yaml
  change: Add the Session tag, five BFF paths, the sessionCookie security scheme, the CsrfToken and ActivityHint
